ss",googleMaterialIcon:"briefcase"},{id:12116,name:"internet",description:"An interconnected network of tubes that connects the entire world together. This tag covers a broad range of tags; anything from cryptocurrency to website analytics.",datasetCount:8596,competitionCount:18,notebookCount:1961,tagUrl:"/tags/internet",displayName:"Internet",googleMaterialIcon:"globe"},{id:11108,name:"finance",description:"The finance tag covers datasets and kernels about money and investing. If you need to test some new cryptocurrency investment strategies or ward off those pesky credit card fraud enthusiasts, then you've come to the right place.",datasetCount:3756,competitionCount:8,notebookCount:3445,tagUrl:"/tags/finance",displayName:"Finance",googleMaterialIcon:"bar-chart"},{id:11121,name:"politics",description:"Politics datasets and kernels cover topics you can use to explore the decision making that goes into the governance of groups of people all around the world.",datasetCount:1685,notebookCount:608,tagUrl:"/tags/politics",displayName:"Politics",googleMaterialIcon:"university"},{id:4202,name:"healthcare",description:"AI in healthcare is a growing interest. One of the major problems is simply converting research into an application. Should be easy, right?",datasetCount:855,competitionCount:9,notebookCount:1156,tagUrl:"/tags/healthcare",displayName:"Healthcare",googleMaterialIcon:"medkit"},{id:11104,name:"crime",description:"A crime is an unlawful act punishable by a state or other authority. Explore datasets, kernels, and competitions related to white collar crime, global terrorism, and more in this tag.",datasetCount:1151,competitionCount:1,notebookCount:574,tagUrl:"/tags/crime",displayName:"Crime",googleMaterialIcon:"balance-scale"},{id:9109,name:"history",description:"History is generally the study of past events that have shaped the world. Here on Kaggle, you'll find historical records and analyses on topics like Bitcoin data, UFO sightings, and sports tournaments.",da